{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0083_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "7957431b713edeadf065345a686aaf8fc7ae6acb75dcbc6226c7920fd224acc3", "ja": "戸惑いのアクトレス", "zh": "困惑的Actress", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0083_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "63746064f84cf5471b4f0e1fbcfd137ef5461308dd228c367f498e7b7306d1b1", "ja": "個人練習に上手く身が入らない未来。そこに\n差し入れを持った春香がやってくる。未来は\n春香を相手に練習を再開するが、やはり同じ\nシーンでつまづいてしまう。春香の指摘に、\n未来はますます頭を悩ませる。", "zh": "未来无法集中精神进行个人练习，\n此时春香带着慰劳品前来。\n未来将春香当作对戏的对象继续练习，\n却又在同一个场景遇到瓶颈。\n春香提出建议，竟反倒让未来更加烦恼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0083_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_03_1000_p", "source_sha256": "faf46b54e49a0aa483580eeb056dd452c4e70e028b0b847b859f620b57aeffb2", "ja": "（あの後、未来に連絡した。ひとりで練習することに\nついては、納得してくれたけど……少し心配だな）", "zh": "（之后我联络了未来。虽然她接受独自练习的提案了……\n但还是有点担心她。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0083_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_03_1001_se", "source_sha256": "ab891e62578da72bb10899bd83d3ea003f20decf24b49e30ef768308acd59625", "ja": "カチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0083_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_03_1002_014mir", "source_sha256": "cb9c823b5710d1ad00c6fc0c386ea8f184c8dd863a16645211914494056fa30a", "ja": "……あ。{$P$}さん！", "zh": "……啊，{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0083_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_03_1003_p", "source_sha256": "899692aeab4bf71ee2266758d69abbe560894e7f28a6ed6ca7b8eb134809e4e3", "ja": "お疲れさま、未来。どうだ、調子は？", "zh": "未来，辛苦你了。状况如何？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0083_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_03_1004_014mir", "source_sha256": "c2ce1e651c5990cf91fbd5253cfdfca8fdd548ca427ca94839688efd37875a66", "ja": "う～。琴葉ちゃんと{$P$}さんに\n言われたとおり、ひとりで台本読んでますけど……。", "zh": "呜～我照着琴叶和{$P$}先生说的，\n自己一个人读剧本……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0083_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_03_1005_014mir", "source_sha256": "bc676b12679eaf2ec45f5b00bc7c5584011e69a44d4f852a249d4fb578a6232a", "ja": "やっぱり、さみしいですよ～！", "zh": "可是感觉真的很寂寞耶～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0083_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_03_1006_p", "source_sha256": "3b145b18d009e291e29bb3c97c0baa02cff8adad8ee4e305132fdbffe18f6559", "ja": "そうか。でも役柄の事を理解するためには、\nこういう時間も必要なんじゃないかな？", "zh": "这样啊，但是为了深入理解角色，\n这种时间也是不可或缺的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0083_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_03_1007_014mir", "source_sha256": "d70c6ce4c76734cf828bbd19f006ff270c7226d94a3e3c6ba4466d6c2101dea1", "ja": "そうですか～？　別に、バラバラじゃなくても\nできると思うんだけどな～……。", "zh": "是吗～？我觉得用不着跟大家分开，\n应该也能做到啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0083_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_03_1008_014mir", "source_sha256": "c7c5f9316d400902d775683c0741cd20de8521e2292bfd5ca6d783425fae461b", "ja": "それに、ひとりでセリフを読んでても、\n相手がいないから、変な感じになっちゃって……。", "zh": "而且一个人念台词、没有人演对手戏，\n感觉也怪怪的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0083_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_03_1009_001har", "source_sha256": "99cb104ccf205f67da345878761c31f0c0913d47f2d449c7e853d014a3b62f99", "ja": "おはようございまーす……あれっ？\n未来ちゃんと{$P$}さんだけ？", "zh": "早安……咦？\n只有未来和{$P$}先生吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0083_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_03_1010_014mir", "source_sha256": "5baa68c4d3fc62dd748093019799808cbb201a841dd273c82a34d562f95bafbf", "ja": "あっ、春香さんだ♪\nおはようございま～す！", "zh": "啊，是春香♪\n早安～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0083_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_03_1011_p", "source_sha256": "c44dd50c8f8985c2e218e8a11884e8bc22c87dafd6f3b335f952de55c2662162", "ja": "お疲れさま、春香。どうかしたのか？\n今日は特にレッスンの予定はなかったよな？", "zh": "辛苦了，春香，你怎么来了？\n你今天应该没有排训练课程吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0083_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_03_1012_001har", "source_sha256": "c5839bbcb8f68e68637d9816b883be35ac42c4a2007335ded689a8b0f7f566eb", "ja": "はい。みんながドラマの練習をしてるって聞いたから、\n差し入れしようと思って。", "zh": "嗯，我听说大家为了电视剧在练习，\n就决定带点慰劳品过来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0083_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_03_1013_001har", "source_sha256": "29fc5883c581f6d75589ca90a859503ce696fc5d70014d7ca48138674afd3cb8", "ja": "家で、お菓子を作ってきたんですけど……\n可奈ちゃんと琴葉ちゃん、一緒じゃなかったんですか？", "zh": "我带了自己在家做的点心……\n不过可奈和琴叶不在这里吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0083_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_03_1014_p", "source_sha256": "a1751731fc80ab5fac2f0ae48f7cee34f70186c8ec1630ba6621e58c30133f9b", "ja": "ああ。役作りのために、未来だけ\nしばらく個人練習をすることになったんだ。", "zh": "没错，为了融入角色，\n我们决定让未来先进行一段个人练习。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0083_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_03_1015_001har", "source_sha256": "1f11c0c0fde22a09a058fa78fc2a683b74ced7531951d13192cd50902a0e456e", "ja": "え、そうだったんですか？\nごめんね未来ちゃん、邪魔しちゃったかな。", "zh": "咦？是这样吗？\n对不起，未来，我好像打扰到你了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0083_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_03_1016_014mir", "source_sha256": "4a521f5a2c51e46c0e6b5d9621d0781908a43cb6af668fd3f4bb243a0dfc5839", "ja": "全然、ジャマなんかじゃないです！\n春香さんが来てくれて、すっごくうれしいです♪", "zh": "完全没有打扰到啦！\n春香来看我，我觉得超开心的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0083_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_03_1017_001har", "source_sha256": "b48a560dac53672bbe6a913f55a16aeea5ebe4ea1056dca07fd3d7a3be84cd80", "ja": "よかった！　……あっ、{$P$}さん。\n私でよかったら、本読み手伝いましょうか？", "zh": "太好了！啊，{$P$}先生，\n不嫌弃的话，要不要让我来帮忙读剧本呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0083_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_03_1018_p", "source_sha256": "9a8d3d7e7858020f92a9be73252ece8fef54cd9d267f3ce64785fb3d8ffdc580", "ja": "いいのか？　春香。\n今日はオフなのに。", "zh": "可以吗，春香？\n今天可是你的休息日耶。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0083_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_03_1019_001har", "source_sha256": "2f52ef43ea688a9414cfd1df9e352374213ac403466ef774739f422bb43bedae", "ja": "もちろん、かまいませんよ。\n未来ちゃんは、劇場の仲間ですからね♪", "zh": "当然没问题啰。\n毕竟未来是剧场的伙伴嘛♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0083_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_03_1020_014mir", "source_sha256": "8ecb2a70039f370700f669c9d1eb370032596d8b0c8fd4e89e7b63f62f77f661", "ja": "いいんですか！？\nやったやった、春香さんと練習だー♪", "zh": "真的可以吗！？\n太好了太好了，可以和春香一起练习～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0083_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_03_1021_p", "source_sha256": "e07f85859f2aab8b64e0a0353b4901bc6dde0a73d15c78185287ed99120de976", "ja": "ありがとう、春香。\nそれじゃ、少しお願いするよ。", "zh": "谢谢你，春香。\n那就拜托你帮忙一下了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0083_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_03_1022_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0083_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_03_1023_001har", "source_sha256": "b80770595d3a7a0513a5f2b0c458773e833e23e9b8a02cf7377d091f48f5d5f9", "ja": "『違うとでも？　……実力も、覚悟もないくせに。\nアイドルになりたいなんて、聞いて呆れる』", "zh": "『不是吗？……你们明明没有实力也没有觉悟，\n还说想当偶像，我真是听不下去了。』", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0083_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_03_1024_014mir", "source_sha256": "4cf41ba6dc5ddc33baf6eaed0d308dc00d4a053bb404a708dcdde32b8db75e9c", "ja": "『ば……馬鹿にしないでっ！　たしかに、\nあなたの方が歌は上手かったかもしれないけど……』", "zh": "『别、别瞧不起我！\n虽然你唱歌的确是唱得比较好……』", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0083_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_03_1025_014mir", "source_sha256": "aefd55cabe1ea1c50e76f2c464a4fc4825538392fa697a2f0f0c30d79034f2ff", "ja": "『だからって、遊びでやってるわけじゃない！\n私は絶対に勝ち残って、アイドルになってみせる！』", "zh": "『但我也不是抱着玩玩的心态！\n我一定会赢到最后，当上偶像给你看！』", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0083_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_03_1026_p", "source_sha256": "ca60fdd2edaffab36d44f3384b4fbd0da64d46a99a3b8c7fbf9585325ba4db37", "ja": "（うーん。昨日の今日とはいえ、未来の演技は\nあまり変わりばえしていないな……）", "zh": "（唔～虽然才过一天也不该苛求，\n但未来的演技几乎没有什么起色啊……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0083_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_03_1027_001har", "source_sha256": "803d0ff361009af9bde08f385d26364ecd0931fefa59f7d9cf16d6aa3135e20f", "ja": "うう～ん……。ねえ、未来ちゃん。今のところだけど、\nやっぱりまだ、私に遠慮してるんじゃない？", "zh": "唔唔……我说未来，\n刚刚那段你是不是还是会顾虑我呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0083_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_03_1028_014mir", "source_sha256": "c0887fbee050b87b1b5c4d93f91c792fe6addcd0d1d49aba23791e37d993daa0", "ja": "あれ～？　ダメ……ですか？", "zh": "咦～？不行……吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0083_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_03_1029_001har", "source_sha256": "6111c7b21b66f7306c4a9c506d3fe31c48846941df54ccf0bf9f16dd16b46dc8", "ja": "『勝ち残って、アイドルになってみせる』……なら、\nまず未来ちゃん自身が、その気持ちにならなくちゃ。", "zh": "『我一定会赢到最后，当上偶像给你看！』……\n既然有这句台词，那未来自己一定要先有这种想法才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0083_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_03_1030_001har", "source_sha256": "8344c37050a2c1db5408cc0ee6d301689c9958111bfba83da811b28da20d5bf4", "ja": "そうしないと、見ている人たちにまで、\nちゃんと伝わらないんじゃないかな……？", "zh": "不然应该很难让观众感受到这份决心吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0083_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_03_1031_p", "source_sha256": "cf845401b290aaebc5c22291b5a9542a85ca216ccb585d28bab7763b49bf0fba", "ja": "未来、琴葉も言ってただろ？\n本気の怒りをぶつけろって……。", "zh": "未来，琴叶也说过吧？\n希望你把真实的愤怒发泄出来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0083_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_03_1032_014mir", "source_sha256": "cdb2253b723ba42a5245e53ffe26bca55ccc074bf0a34ca43d3972a6bb3ca7d6", "ja": "で、でも。本当の春香さんや琴葉ちゃんは、\n絶対、こんなこと言わないじゃないですか。", "zh": "但、但是，\n真正的春香和琴叶绝对不会说出这种话呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0083_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_03_1033_p", "source_sha256": "f82c33a90791cdcd6dadefa34c689fa25d9360b4ba68db3fe3f235c36ca6592f", "ja": "未来、それは……。", "zh": "未来，关于这个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0083_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_03_1034_014mir", "source_sha256": "dd441ebfb834ea7ac8df95664e0b6493fe88545d8a28c1c076cdfe1943cd85fc", "ja": "それなのに、怒ったり、\n嫌いになったりなんかできないですよ～。", "zh": "这样的话，我就没办法生气或讨厌她们嘛～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0083_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_03_1035_001har", "source_sha256": "c6ce46e278daa27c71ba49a5252e8c60206f053908421d16539dc9e0c5c05996", "ja": "ねえ、未来ちゃん。お芝居してるのは私だけど、\nその言葉を話しているのは、私じゃないんだよ。", "zh": "听我说，未来，虽然演戏的人是我，\n但说出那些话的人并不是我喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0083_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_03_1036_001har", "source_sha256": "5f6a706250baeedcc000c52c9ceecbe98927224a1a50c55fffc87f12901c4071", "ja": "お芝居なのに、普段の気持ちが出ちゃうのは……\nお仕事に、本気になれてないってことじゃないかな？", "zh": "明明在演戏，却表现出平常的感情……\n不就代表没有认真投入在工作上吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0083_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_03_1037_014mir", "source_sha256": "bb1bc5986e5b6d3f32fe58c02ffd1b2d78cf2df332649e324bd0b4378bcb483a", "ja": "え……。", "zh": "咦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0083_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_03_1038_001har", "source_sha256": "9f60238e22c8223344cecb00caf7c9507a4386b45801b314d8cbe05d1b3d52dc", "ja": "お芝居に参加するなら、本気でやらなくちゃダメだよ。\nだって、そうじゃないと……。", "zh": "参与戏剧演出一定要认真投入才行。\n因为，如果不认真的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0083_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_03_1039_001har", "source_sha256": "38ede85b18b9b0e413168907a48aa91d5ff40575550aef6bfa0d24b8c5f7267f", "ja": "未来ちゃんだけじゃなくて、一緒に演じる琴葉ちゃんや\n可奈ちゃんまで、ニセモノに見えちゃうよ。", "zh": "不仅是未来，\n连一起演戏的琴叶和可奈看起来都会假假的喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0083_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_03_1040_001har", "source_sha256": "f07335b4ad9c4e69b97f7140c8da6c10913baa45e845f0c021cb0baf524aa360", "ja": "本物の『アイドルを目指す女の子たち』だって、\nドラマを見ている人たち、誰も思ってくれないと思う。", "zh": "这样收看电视剧的观众，\n应该都不会觉得你们真的是『以偶像为目标的女孩子』。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0083_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_03_1041_014mir", "source_sha256": "10e3b358e325593d0fb83c1e88fc03b76848820df6e950711b442bd9c90b625f", "ja": "ニセモノに……\n私のせいで、みんなも？", "zh": "看起来假假的……\n我会害到大家？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0083_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_03_1042_001har", "source_sha256": "fa150eee9264b3c1464fecf7907993ef705143478e3567df8e42e0969ed3838d", "ja": "そう。だからみんなのためにも、\n未来ちゃんが頑張らなきゃ。……ね？", "zh": "没错，所以为了大家，\n未来得好好加油才是……知道吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0083_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_03_1044_p", "source_sha256": "41a6f3fe3825ca53c5b95e0b5709e11012c989a92cebb5576af3938597216d0a", "ja": "（さすがの未来も、ちょっと堪えたみたいだな……\nでも、春香の言っている事は正しい）", "zh": "（即便是未来，听了这番话似乎也有些难受啊……\n但春香说的是对的。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0083_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_03_1045_p", "source_sha256": "34b3adad507320604821e52c649360253590beaf371d61138328977c192d9e95", "ja": "（いつかは乗り越えなくちゃいけない壁なんだ。\n……頑張ってくれ、未来）", "zh": "（这是总有一天必须跨越的障碍……\n加油吧，未来。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
